OL,3,GNEWSAOver 11,000 bin collections missed
OL,4,Ain five months
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver 11,000 missed bin collections were
OL,7,Freported across the Bradford district
OL,8,Fin a single five-month period this
OL,9,Fyear, new figures have revealed.
OL,11,FBradford Council has confirmed it
OL,12,Freceived 11,150 reports of missed
OL,13,Fgeneral waste and recycling collections
OL,14,Fbetween 1 May and 2 October, amid
OL,15,Fcontinuing complaints from residents
OL,16,Fabout the recent reliability of the
OL,17,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
