OL,3,GNEWSAOver 11,000 bin collections missed
OL,4,Ain five months
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ian Walker, the authority's
OL,7,Fexecutive member for neighbourhoods and
OL,8,Fcommunities, said an "improvement plan"
OL,9,Fto increase reliability of bin
OL,10,Fcollections was under way.
OL,12,F"While action is still in progress,
OL,13,Fthere has been a marked improvement in
OL,14,Fcollection reliability in the last two
OL,15,Fweeks," he added.
